    "Echo Cancellation": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suppression de l’écho"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get started": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C’est parti"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hear the difference": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écoutez la différence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hush": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hush"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hush Microphone": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hush Microphone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hush Microphone is installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hush Microphone est installé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hush adds a microphone called “Hush Microphone” that Discord, Zoom, Meet or OBS can use. macOS will ask for your password once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hush ajoute un micro appelé « Hush Microphone », utilisable dans Discord, Zoom, Meet ou OBS. macOS vous demandera votre mot de passe une seule fois."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hush already removes echo and noise: turning Discord’s own processing off avoids cleaning your voice twice. The same goes for Zoom, Meet or OBS — just pick “Hush Microphone” as the microphone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hush supprime déjà l’écho et le bruit : désactiver le traitement de Discord évite de nettoyer votre voix deux fois. Même chose pour Zoom, Meet ou OBS : choisissez simplement « Hush Microphone » comme micro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hush can’t reach its virtual microphone": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hush n’arrive pas à joindre son micro virtuel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hush can’t use your microphone": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hush n’a pas accès au micro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hush listens to your microphone, removes the sound of your speakers, and passes your voice on. Nothing is recorded or sent anywhere.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hush écoute votre micro, retire le son de vos haut-parleurs et transmet votre voix. Rien n’est enregistré ni envoyé ailleurs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hush needs to install its virtual microphone. This is done once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hush doit installer son micro virtuel. Cela ne se fait qu’une fois."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hush needs to remove its virtual microphone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hush doit retirer son micro virtuel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "INPUT DEVICE": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PÉRIPHÉRIQUE D’ENTRÉE"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Automatic mode, Hush only runs while an app such as Discord is using “Hush Microphone”, so your music sounds normal the rest of the time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En mode automatique, Hush ne tourne que lorsqu’une app comme Discord utilise « Hush Microphone » : le reste du temps, votre musique sonne normalement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Input device: Hush Microphone. Echo Cancellation off, Noise Suppression None, Automatic Gain Control off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Périphérique d’entrée : Hush Microphone. Suppression de l’écho désactivée, Réduction du bruit sur Aucune, Contrôle automatique du gain désactivé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install it from the Hush menu. It only takes a few seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installez-le depuis le menu Hush. Cela prend quelques secondes."
